0..73 Comment "// A theory\'s constant: `oper z : T` states a value of the type after the"
74..149 Comment "// colon, a sort of the theory or a builtin type, and a model gives it by a"
150..224 Comment "// value definition, as `phase.gandr`\'s record signature gives `z : T` and"
225..303 Comment "// `module-signature-matching.gandr`\'s gives `base : Integer`. An operation of"
304..377 Comment "// no inputs, `oper zero : () --> M` (`../include/monoid.gandr`), stays a"
378..451 Comment "// function of none. A law applies a constant as it applies an operation,"
452..515 Comment "// `e()`, and the model\'s law reads the constant\'s value there."
